meta { title = "Built-in functions", description = "Alphabetical index of every public built-in call and numeric conversion.", order = 0, group = "Library reference" }

This is the alphabetical index of callable built-ins implemented by the native language. No import is needed. User-defined record and enum constructors are described in the language reference. Operators and task syntax are language constructs, not extra functions.

